   "notes": "Described the 1B config as primary; it uses weight tying, while the 7B does not ('7B & 32 & 4086 & 32 & 2.46T & ... & no'). Table 1 gives the 7B hidden dimension as 4086, but the appendix table gives 4096; 4096 is used. The 7B kv heads are taken from attention variant 'full' (standard MHA). Not stated anywhere in the paper: norm placement (pre/post), norm eps, RoPE pairing/theta, head_dim, the 1B d_ff (only '~8/3 d, rounded to a multiple of 128'), and whether a final norm comes before the head (none is included). Residual adds are drawn as standard transformer residuals but the paper does not state them explicitly. The tokenizer vocabulary is 50280; the embedding matrix is padded to 50304. The model is dense (no MoE), but this is not stated explicitly."
